{"title":"Hides Before the Frost","html":"<article class=\"wp g-page\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">Linnet Birch makes quivers and bow grips for Underleaf&#39;s archers, and she has run out of good hide before the cold months.</p><section id=\"g-about\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-facts\"><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Given by</td><td><a href=\"#/npc/linnet-birch\">Linnet Birch</a> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"linnet-birch\">Show on map</button></td></tr><tr><td>Level</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>Length</td><td>Short</td></tr><tr><td>Kind</td><td>Side</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-needs\"><h2>What you need</h2><ul class=\"q-needs\"><li><a href=\"#/item/bear-hide\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/b5fe7fee0b1329cf8742.svg\" alt=\"\">Bear Hide</a> <b>×5</b></li></ul></section><section id=\"g-steps\"><h2>Steps</h2><ol class=\"q-steps\"><li value=\"1\">Talk to <a href=\"#/npc/linnet-birch\">Linnet Birch</a> <span class=\"muted\">(outdoors near Underleaf)</span> to get the quest. <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"linnet-birch\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"2\">Bring 5 bear hides to Linnet Birch <span class=\"muted\">(5)</span> - <a href=\"#/item/bear-hide\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/b5fe7fee0b1329cf8742.svg\" alt=\"\">Bear Hide</a> <span class=\"muted\">at -36, 200</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"-36|200|Bring 5 bear hides to Linnet Birch\">Show on map</button></li></ol></section><section id=\"g-rewards\"><h2>Rewards</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-rewards\"><thead><tr><th>Reward</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gold</td><td>160</td></tr><tr><td>Character XP</td><td>6,000</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section></div>\n      <aside class=\"wp-infobox g-aside\"><h3>Hides Before the Frost</h3><p class=\"g-aside-group\">Quests</p><p class=\"g-aside-h\">On this page</p><ol class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-underleaf-hides-before-the-frost\" data-g-jump=\"g-about\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-underleaf-hides-before-the-frost\" data-g-jump=\"g-needs\">What you need</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-underleaf-hides-before-the-frost\" data-g-jump=\"g-steps\">Steps</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-underleaf-hides-before-the-frost\" data-g-jump=\"g-rewards\">Rewards</a></li></ol><p class=\"g-aside-h\">Related guides</p><ul class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quests\">All quests</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/travel\">Travel &amp; quests</a></li></ul><p class=\"g-aside-h\"><a href=\"#/guides\">All guides</a></p><p class=\"g-note\">From the game’s own data, what players have recorded, and the <a href=\"https://binxonia.com/guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">official guide</a>.</p></aside></article>"}